  <releases>
    <release version="0.5" date="2026-10-20">
      <description translate="no">
        <p>Custom difficulty and settings improvements:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            Custom difficulty: choose which operations to include
            (addition, subtraction, multiplication, division, integer
            division, modulo), set custom number ranges for each, and
            decide whether subtraction results may be negative. Defaults
            match the Medium preset.
          </li>
          <li>
            It is also available in the difficulty selection menu and
            appears in the statistics alongside the preset difficulty levels.
          </li>
          <li>
            Difficulty levels have been rebalanced:
            the parameters for the "Medium" and "Hard" modes have been adjusted.
          </li>
          <li>
            Easy difficulty now includes simple multiplication.
          </li>
          <li>
            Various internal improvements and bug fixes.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </description>
    </release>

    <release version="0.4" date="2026-10-07">
      <description translate="no">
        <p>Adding a custom difficulty level:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Added a setting for the number of recent matches displayed</li>
          <li>Icons are now installed in the project</li>
          <li>Icons for difficulty levels have been added</li>
          <li>And other minor improvements</li>
        </ul>
      </description>
    </release>

    <release version="0.3" date="2026-10-05">
